OL,3,GNEWSADog warning as suspected palm oil
OL,4,Awashes up on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog owners have been put on alert after
OL,7,Fsuspected palm oil washed up on a
OL,8,FMerseyside beach.
OL,10,FLumps of the waxy substance were
OL,11,Flocated on Egremont beach in Wirral
OL,12,Fafter reports to Wirral Coastguard
OL,13,FRescue Team.
OL,15,FPalm oil is widely used in the food
OL,16,Findustry but when dumped at sea it can
OL,17,Fbecome toxic.
OL,19,FThe coastguard said dogs could be
OL,20,Fattracted to the smell and might try to
OL,21,Feat it - and if it was ingested it
OL,22,Fcould cause a fatal reaction.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
